{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_bf946e91d4fc4d64a5acd01b","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Database environment notes (observed 2026-10-02)\n2\t\n3\t## Schema layout (verified via sqlite_master)\n4\tThree independent product datasets, table names suffixed `_g1` / `_g2` / `_g3`:\n5\t\n6\t- **g1 = Office Products** — tables: `items_g1`, `fdbk_g1`, `fdbk_stats_g1`, `attrs_g1`, `taxn_g1`\n7\t- **g2 = Electronics** — tables: `items_g2`, `fdbk_g2`, `taxn_g2` (no attrs/stats tables)\n8\t- **g3 = Musical Instruments** — tables: `items_g3`, `fdbk_g3`, `attrs_g3` (no taxonomy table)\n9\t\n10\tCategory assignment is **verified** from `main_cat` value counts in each `items_*` table:\n11\t- `items_g1`: Office Products 13,933 (dominant)\n12\t- `items_g2`: Computers 5,247, All Electronics 4,562, Camera & Photo 2,789, Cell Phones & Accessories 1,775 (electronics-dominant)\n13\t- `items_g3`: Musical Instruments 17,162 (dominant)\n14\t\n15\t## Key columns (verified via CREATE TABLE statements)\n16\t- `items_g2`: `ref_id` PK, `ttl`, `avg_rtg`, `prc` (INTEGER), `prc_usd` (REAL), `main_cat`, `feat_lst`, `img_ct`\n17\t- `fdbk_g2`: `ref_id` (FK → items_g2), `uid`, `rtg` REAL, `ttl`, `body` TEXT, `ts`, `hlp_ct`, `vrf` (TEXT in g2, INTEGER in g1/g3)\n18\t\n19\t## Data facts (verified by query)\n20\t- `items_g2.prc` is **in cents**, `prc_usd` is in dollars — confirmed consistent (0 rows where `ABS(prc - prc_usd*100) > 0.01`); 224 rows have null-pattern mismatch between the two fields. Use `prc_usd <= 40` for dollar thresholds.\n21\t- `items_g2` has 20,000 rows; 6,570 have `prc`, 6,346 have `prc_usd` (many null prices).\n22\t- `fdbk_g2.rtg` values are only 1.0–5.0 (counts: 5★ 49,611; 4★ 10,492; 3★ 5,682; 2★ 3,791; 1★ 7,446).\n23\t- All `fdbk_g2.ref_id` values match `items_g2.ref_id` (0 unmatched on LEFT JOIN) — inner join safe.\n24\t\n25\t## Inference vs. verification\n26\t- Price-unit interpretation (cents vs dollars) is **verified** numerically, not inferred from column names.\n27\t- Electronics = g2 is **verified** from `main_cat` dominance; g1/g3 assignments likewise.\n28\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"da51eb81-6093-4799-bd08-b524982c5313","uuid":"9e616df9-fa11-4678-b14c-b8056142af37","timestamp":"2026-10-01T17:35:07.209Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\campus_re\\experiments\\memory_direction_20261002\\workspaces\\v2-glm-b9-native-r1\\memory\\environment.md","content":"# Database environment notes (observed 2026-10-02)\n\n## Schema layout (verified via sqlite_master)\nThree independent product datasets, table names suffixed `_g1` / `_g2` / `_g3`:\n\n- **g1 = Office Products** — tables: `items_g1`, `fdbk_g1`, `fdbk_stats_g1`, `attrs_g1`, `taxn_g1`\n- **g2 = Electronics** — tables: `items_g2`, `fdbk_g2`, `taxn_g2` (no attrs/stats tables)\n- **g3 = Musical Instruments** — tables: `items_g3`, `fdbk_g3`, `attrs_g3` (no taxonomy table)\n\nCategory assignment is **verified** from `main_cat` value counts in each `items_*` table:\n- `items_g1`: Office Products 13,933 (dominant)\n- `items_g2`: Computers 5,247, All Electronics 4,562, Camera & Photo 2,789, Cell Phones & Accessories 1,775 (electronics-dominant)\n- `items_g3`: Musical Instruments 17,162 (dominant)\n\n## Key columns (verified via CREATE TABLE statements)\n- `items_g2`: `ref_id` PK, `ttl`, `avg_rtg`, `prc` (INTEGER), `prc_usd` (REAL), `main_cat`, `feat_lst`, `img_ct`\n- `fdbk_g2`: `ref_id` (FK → items_g2), `uid`, `rtg` REAL, `ttl`, `body` TEXT, `ts`, `hlp_ct`, `vrf` (TEXT in g2, INTEGER in g1/g3)\n\n## Data facts (verified by query)\n- `items_g2.prc` is **in cents**, `prc_usd` is in dollars — confirmed consistent (0 rows where `ABS(prc - prc_usd*100) > 0.01`); 224 rows have null-pattern mismatch between the two fields. Use `prc_usd <= 40` for dollar thresholds.\n- `items_g2` has 20,000 rows; 6,570 have `prc`, 6,346 have `prc_usd` (many null prices).\n- `fdbk_g2.rtg` values are only 1.0–5.0 (counts: 5★ 49,611; 4★ 10,492; 3★ 5,682; 2★ 3,791; 1★ 7,446).\n- All `fdbk_g2.ref_id` values match `items_g2.ref_id` (0 unmatched on LEFT JOIN) — inner join safe.\n\n## Inference vs. verification\n- Price-unit interpretation (cents vs dollars) is **verified** numerically, not inferred from column names.\n- Electronics = g2 is **verified** from `main_cat` dominance; g1/g3 assignments likewise.\n","numLines":28,"startLine":1,"totalLines":28}}}
